abstract: >-
  Dataset and interactive street-network maps for the paper
  Measurement-Dependent Clustering in an Urban Observatory Sensor
  Network. Fourteen maps (2013-2026) show the OpenStreetMap street
  graph and the sensor locations for each year, generated by the
  public Kaggle notebook from the public dataset.
